      "kb": "not-a-lil-fish",
      "recordId": "not-a-lil-fish:wisdom:35",
      "statement": "Keep a discretionary take-or-skip step instead of full automation: the mechanical version of his own sweep-and-reclaim C2 model had zero surviving variants and a median trade of -0.175R.",
