      "recordId": "not-a-lil-fish:wisdom:21",
      "statement": "If a backtest loses consistently across every asset, test the exact inverse by swapping each stop loss and take profit; his 2,500-trade backtest was negative on all eight assets and the inverse showed a 61.3% win rate.",
